          <div class="bz-hero-proof">
            <span><span class="bz-stars">★★★★★</span> <b>[4,8]</b> · [+2.300] opiniones</span>
            <span>Viral en <span class="bz-chip-tt">TikTok</span></span>
            <span>#1 en <span class="bz-chip-ml">Mercado Libre</span></span>
          </div>
          <div class="bz-hero-cta">
            <a class="bz-btn" href="#razon-1">Leer la nota <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
            <a class="bz-link" href="#oferta">Ver el producto</a>
          </div>
          <div class="bz-byline">
            <span class="bz-avatar">DW</span>
